<http://data.silknow.org/object/8b0fe0fa-9566-374a-81f6-215899bf55a1>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Brocaded with silver wire wound on a silk core on a compound satin ground with stripes shaded from white to dark green.  On each side of these is a feathery stripe in shades of yellow and green.  Between these, floral sprays brocaded in silver.  Selvedge on both sides of eight cords.  Soiled, silver tarnished."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/0d5c8e09-0461-3fc3-af69-1aa91982447f> ;
